flaticron (0.2~pre3) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Add man page for flaticron(8) command.
  * Allow overriding EMAIL from command line with --email <addr>.
  * Add network-online.target as dependency to systemd services.
  * Call bsd-mailx explicitly and update dependency
    to avoid incompatible mailx implementations.
  * Bump Standards-Version to 4.7.2.
  * Add Rules-Requires-Root: no to allow rootless builds.

